# Who reviews what (GOVERNANCE.md), in the public repository bloque-app/aledgent. The teams must exist
# in bloque-app.

*                       @bloque-app/aledgent-maintainers

# The specification and its amendments: the spec owner rules on them.
/SPEC.md                @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/amendments/            @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/GOVERNANCE.md          @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner

# Licensing: the licence boundary between agents/ (AGPL) and the rest.
/docs/oss/              @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/REUSE.toml             @bloque-app/aledgent-maintainers
/LICENSES/              @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/tools/ci/check-no-vos.sh @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner

# The code-history gate (T-037-12): the recorded history every build must replay, and what holds
# it. A change here changes what "the history still replays" means.
/crates/core-binding/tests/fixtures/code-history/ @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/crates/core-binding/tests/code_history.rs        @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/tools/ci/check-code-history-fixture.sh           @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/.github/workflows/code-history.yml               @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner

# The judge of what CI skips (bloque-app/bloque-ledgent#312): the gate decides which required checks
# report success without running. The script and the action are read from the BASE, so a change here
# takes effect only once it is on the base; ci.yml carries the gate job and every check's skip path.
/tools/ci/tested-tree.py                 @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/tools/ci/test-tested-tree.py            @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/.github/actions/tested-tree/            @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/.github/workflows/ci.yml                @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner

# What a release takes from a pre-release instead of building (bloque-app/bloque-ledgent#312, step
# 3): the judge of which images are promoted by digest to the release's tags, the workflows that
# build and publish the images, and the guard that the core image reports no version.
/tools/release/promote-images.py         @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/tools/release/test-promote-images.py    @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/.github/workflows/release.yml           @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/.github/workflows/images.yml            @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
/tools/ci/check-no-version-sites.sh      @bloque-app/aledgent-spec-owner
